  <NAME>Neuroinflammatory astrocyte subtypes in the mouse brain [scRNAseq]</NAME>
  <TITLE>Neuroinflammatory astrocyte subtypes in the mouse brain [scRNAseq]</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Single cell RNAseq of FACS-purified astrcoytes from saline- and LPS-injected Aldh1l1egfp mice at 24h and comparison male vs female Overall design: Astrocytes were FACS-purified from LPS- or saline-treated (24h) Aldh1l1egfp mice, run on the 10xChromium system and sequenced on NovaSeq6000. 3 saline female, 3 saline male, 3 LPS female, 3 LPS male animals</DESCRIPTION>
